<!-- Engine forked from skin.groove 1.0.1 (M1; Groove's copy came from Nocturne / Majan's make_keyboard.py); drawn as a
     Vernissage card in M4 (skin-developer, 2026-10-21). Hand-edited: there is no keyboard generator. -->
<!--
	Kodi's on-screen keyboard as a placard card (screens/Custom_1150_Search.md, "DialogKeyboard (card)"): the room dims
	(scrim, own fades), card 360, 300, 1200 x 600; Kodi's heading 311 in ink2, the typed text 312 in the exhibition face
	(font_exhibit) over the 56 x 2 placard rule; keys as 64 x 64 tiles (1 px card_edge outline, ink letters; focused =
	2 px ink ring), function keys in ink2; Done / Cancel / layout / IP column at the right (fixed 200 px, nothing
	re-flows). Kodi-owned behaviour unchanged.
	Id contract (Estuary Omega DialogKeyboard.xml): 311 heading, 312 edit, 313 / 314 IME lines, keys 100-112, 120-132,
	140-152, 160-172 (Kodi writes their labels), 304 symbols, 303 caps, 302 shift, 32 space, 305 / 306 cursor,
	8 backspace, 300 done, 301 cancel, 310 / 309 layout, 307 IP address. (9010, Estuary's CJK candidate panel, is not
	drawn: the Arial fontset has no CJK either, CONVENTIONS 5.)
	Glyphs: only characters Inter Tight has (cursor keys are U+2039 / U+203A, LESSONS Groove device audit).
	Focus: default 300 (Done) on every open; the key rows wrap Left / Right into the button column 95200 and back.
-->
